  "description": "<p><span>Moody MuMu is all about socks and tights. Legwear is our passion. </span></p>\r\n<p><span>We started as a small stall in the Brick Lane market in London where our products were praised by sock lovers from around the globe. Driven by our shared ethusiasm for pretty legwear, we were encouraged to move the business online so that socks people around the world know where to buy what they love.</span></p>\r\n<p><span>Moody MuMu is the No.1 store to buy pretty legwear. It is also a&nbsp;hub for people to connect and share the eternal love of socks and tights. If you ever asked &ldquo;Which socks/tights should I wear today,&rdquo; then this is the place for you!</span></p>\r\n<p><span>For all legwear lovers, please follow us on Instagram (@moodymumu_) and Tiktok(@moodymumu). And we would always love to&nbsp;hear your ideas and/or stories about legwear through email at&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" aria-describedby=\"a11y-external-message\" href=\"mailto:info@moodymumu.com\" rel=\"noopener\">info@moodymumu.com</a>. Keep in touch! Our conmunity is getting stronger!&nbsp;</span></p>",
